<title>LEBANON: SOCCER-KUWAIT BEAT LEBANON 3-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KUWAIT BEAT LEBANON 3-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait beat Lebanon 3-1 (halftime</p>
<p>2-1) in their World Cup Asian zone group seven qualifying group</p>
<p>on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Lebanon - Abd al-Fattah Shuhab 29</p>
<p>Kuwait - Faisal Outaibi 9, Hamad al-Saleh 31, 74</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,000</p>
<p>    Final standings   P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> Kuwait		   4   4   0   0  10   1   12</p>
<p> Lebanon		  4   1  1   2   4   7    4</p>
<p> Singapore		4   0   1   3   2   8    1</p>
<p>Kuwait qualify for second round.</p>
</text>
